<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Access matters more than distance</p>
      <h2>What actually decides whether we can help</h2>
      <p class="lede">
        Travel is rarely the problem on a commercial job. These are the things
        that are.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <ul class="checks">
        <li><strong>Site size.</strong> Small patch repairs far out of town are
        rarely worth the travel. A full repaint usually is.</li>
        <li><strong>Access.</strong> Loading dock, forklift access, room for a
        boom or scaffold, and whether the street will take a truck.</li>
        <li><strong>Height.</strong> Whether a rope access operator is
        appropriate, and how it changes the programme.</li>
        <li><strong>Timing.</strong> Whether you can work to your shutdown, or
        need us out overnight.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Send the details through the
        <a href="/contact/">quote form</a> and we will tell you straight away
        whether it is worth a site visit.
      </p>
